[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723209233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114716#issuecomment-3723209233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114716","id":3723209233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d66oR","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T10:26:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T10:26:08Z","body":"I'm not sure to understand the issue.\n\nThe warning you're seeing on 4.5.1 is because \"New Game Project\" is a Godot 4.6 project (newer than 4.5), so there's a risk it can't be opened properly in 4.5.1, thus it shows a warning to let you know of it before you attempt to open it.\n\nIn 4.6, this same project is now compatible (authored with 4.6) so there would be no warning. There is also no warning for \"Test Project 4.5\" by design, we don't show warnings for projects created in _older_ versions, as those are typically still compatible. There is a warning dialog when opening them to confirm that you want to convert them to 4.6.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723209233/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723333619","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114716#issuecomment-3723333619","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114716","id":3723333619,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d7Y_z","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T10:59:30Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T10:59:30Z","body":"Thank you muchly for your detailed answer. That's exactly what I doubt.\n\nI tought that the warning mark would be there as long as the editor's version is different, which is the same as the warning dialog.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723333619/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocke